# nibOS: the RG DS+'s changes to mainline's RG DS defconfig, merged by
# uboot/build.sh into every build.
#
# The RG DS config switches the device off when the charger powered it on; the
# PMIC remembers that across restarts, so the device would then switch itself
# off at every reboot. Plugging in should charge, not power-cycle.
# CONFIG_ROCKCHIP_RK8XX_DISABLE_BOOT_ON_POWERON is not set
